{"id":"en_the-mafia-boss-made-me-his-maid","title":"The Mafia Boss Made Me His Maid","titleEn":"The Mafia Boss Made Me His Maid","description":"Elena, a gifted young scientist, finds her life upended when she is seized by Riccardo Bellini, a merciless mafia boss, to settle a debt owed by her brother. Held in his mansion and forced to serve as his maid against her will, she clings to the goal of breaking free and rebuilding the future she fought for. Yet with rivals circling and a lethal plot endangering Riccardo's criminal empire, the boundary between captor and guardian starts to fade. Torn between the life she lost and the perilous man who won't release her, Elena faces a choice: whether to risk everything she once wanted for love. In a realm of power, treachery, and fixation, freedom could demand the ultimate cost.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-mafia-boss-made-me-his-maid/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-mafia-boss-made-me-his-maid/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df578/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-mafia-boss-made-me-his-maid_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df578/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-mafia-boss-made-me-his-maid_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df578/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-mafia-boss-made-me-his-maid_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df578/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id"